<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for contacting us about your booking
reference {!Case.Booking_PNR__c}.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">We understand that plans change and regret you
were unable to travel as originally booked. Our advanced seat selection
conditions state that, if you elect to cancel your booking, move to another
flight or higher cabin, or fail to check in for your flight, any seat selection
paid is non-refundable&nbsp;<b><i>-and cannot be transferred to another flight-</i></b>.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">In line with these conditions, we are unable
to meet your request for a refund. What we can do is provide a letter for your
travel insurer confirming the changes and forfeited costs. If you are able to
make a claim through your policy and would like us to provide a letter, please request
by replying to this email.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">





</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" style=""><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">I appreciate this is not the answer you were
hoping for but thank you again for contacting us. I hope that we will have the
opportunity to welcome you onboard soon.<br></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br>Kind regards<br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br>{!User.FirstName}<br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br>Qantas Customer Care<br></span><br><font style=""><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"><br></font></font></font></p><div style="text-align: center;"><font size="2" style=""><font style=""><font style=""><font color="#ffffff" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></font></font></font></div><font size="2" style=""><span style="text-align: center;"><div style="text-align: center;"><font color="#ffffff" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></div></span></font><p style=""></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><div style="text-align: center;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></div><div style="text-align: center;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center;"><p style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="text-align: start;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: start;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p></div></span><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start;"><font style=""><span style="text-align: center;"><div style="text-align: center;"><br></div></span><font size="2" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; font-family: arial;"></span></font></font></div><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>